# Veripsa release gate (auto-discovered). One gate per file -> two PRs adding gates add two
# FILES, never a shared line -> no false merge conflict on registration. register_gate is
# defined in run_gates.sh. Format: register_gate <test> <marker> <name> <ok_blurb> <desc> [tail]
register_gate "tests/test_core_recall.py" "CORE RECALL GATE: PASS" "python bare-decorator recall" "python bare-decorator recall: a Python @setupmethod-decorated symbol DEPENDS ON the file defining the decorator, but the call graph missed the BARE form — a CALLED decorator @app.route(...) is an ast.Call already walked (emits 'route'), while a bare @setupmethod is an ast.Name/Attribute that produced NO edge -> a silent CLEAR; this is the SAME high-precision sym_use family as the base-class edge (a decorator name is SPECIFIC, rarely ubiquitous); MEASURED on pallets/flask full history: live dampened co-change recall 31.3 -> 32.2 pct (+3 GT pairs) / raw 41.4 -> 42.2 pct (+3), dampening-killed column UNCHANGED at 35 (the new edges added no noise), every net-new pair a REAL imported single-definer decorator link (e.g. sansio/app.py + sansio/blueprints.py each apply @setupmethod imported from sansio/scaffold.py), zero fabricated couplings; the decorator is emitted as a CONTENT-FREE calls edge to the bare NAME so it flows through the EXACT same _claim_adjacency resolution every call passes — defs<=3 fan-out cap, import-confirmation, single-definer, hub dampening — so a builtin (@property) or multi-definer un-imported decorator is DROPPED not fanned out; a CALLED decorator is NOT double-emitted; gate proves recall (imported single-definer decorator WARNS), precision (multi-definer un-imported decorator stays CLEAR = false_coupling invariant), no double-emit, content-free, and a control that the recall check is load-bearing" "python bare-decorator recall: a decorator is real cross-file coupling — a decorated symbol + the decorator's file must coordinate; recall-safe and precision-preserving (routed through the resolver, called-decorator double-emit avoided)" 30
